# A closed, consistently outward-wound cube — the smallest subject that
# exercises the whole pipeline.
#
# The winding is a property of the fixture, not something the scenario
# asserts through it. Scrambling it here does not empty the frame: the
# level set finds spurious crossings all over a mesh whose normals
# disagree, so coverage roughly doubles rather than collapsing. Winding is
# gated directly by `obj_winding_survives_the_reader`, which measures the
# orientation agreement instead of hoping a drawing reflects it.
#
# Deliberately not a likeness. What is gated is that a loaded mesh yields
# strokes at all; whether a particular subject looks right is a person
# looking at a window, and does not belong in CI.
v -1 -1 -1
v 1 -1 -1
v 1 1 -1
v -1 1 -1
v -1 -1 1
v 1 -1 1
v 1 1 1
v -1 1 1
f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
f 3 4 8
f 3 8 7
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
